# Video wall on the 4K (HDMI0) output — 3x3 grid.
# One RTSP URL per line, in row-major order (left-to-right, top-to-bottom):
#   1 2 3
#   4 5 6
#   7 8 9
#
# Exactly 9 non-comment lines are required.
#
# Get each URL from UniFi Protect: Camera -> Settings -> RTSP, enable the
# "Medium" quality alias for each camera, then paste the URL Protect shows you.
# Typical form: rtsp://<protect-host>:7447/<alias>
#
# Example (replace with your real cameras):
# rtsp://192.168.1.10:7447/abcd1234
# rtsp://192.168.1.10:7447/abcd1235
# rtsp://192.168.1.10:7447/abcd1236
# rtsp://192.168.1.10:7447/abcd1237
# rtsp://192.168.1.10:7447/abcd1238
# rtsp://192.168.1.10:7447/abcd1239
# rtsp://192.168.1.10:7447/abcd123a
# rtsp://192.168.1.10:7447/abcd123b
# rtsp://192.168.1.10:7447/abcd123c
